      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Star mare CAPTAINS MISTRESS NZ (1) makes her first appearance since she downed Leap To Fame for an epic Inter Dominion Final win in July, stretching her winning streak to six. Readied with two strong trials and has the speed to take advantage of the inside draw so is impossible to tip against. HI MANAMEISJEFF NZ (7) led from one spot wider and stuck on in his resuming third. Has won four of five tries at this longer distance and strikes at 50 per cent when second up so should be improved. KINGMAN NZ (4) broke early and raced wide when resuming so forgive that result. Should be better for it and draws lower so expect to see much better from him tonight. MAX DELIGHT (11) draws wide but found winning form last week.",
